{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026M86Zeu6vCH1794977651.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>準備出席中俄美元首會晤的美國總統特朗普，早上繼續在菲律賓的行程，與菲律賓總統小馬可斯舉行會談。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.TRUMP-1130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RwgyQxVQxN1794977708.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>小馬可斯在馬尼拉總統府為特朗普舉行歡迎儀式，現場鳴放21響禮炮。兩人檢閱儀仗隊，隨後展開雙邊會談。路透社報道，在中國加強南海活動之際，小馬可斯或藉此會面機會，爭取美國對印太地區更強力的安全承諾。</p><p></p><p>特朗普還會和小馬可斯共晉工作午餐，下午啟程前往深圳，明天將出席亞太經合組織APEC會議，並參與歷史性中俄美元首會晤。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.297379+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:26:53.218531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:45.911419+00:00","content_hash":"02d9cb3ac60ee8c588dbaa4ee694aad23b08064845859be58a3dac23758b4f14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.297379+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}